# Vercel's Node builder turns api/**/*.{js,mjs,ts} into serverless functions, and
# the Hobby plan caps them at 12 — we are AT 12. A stray test file next to a route
# silently pushes it to 13 and the deploy fails at "Deploying outputs", which has
# already happened once. Tests never belong in the deployment.
*.test.mjs
*.test.js
*.check.mjs
